.git
.github
.claude
.claude-memory
tests/
docs/
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
.gitignore
.eslintrc*
.prettierrc*
node_modules/

# The Python checker ships; its test fixtures do not. A user installing
# gimme-the-lint has no use for our pytest suite, and the broken-app fixtures
# are deliberately full of bugs — shipping them would put a dozen files
# containing known-defective SQLAlchemy models into every consumer node_modules.
python/tests/
python/.venv/
python/**/__pycache__/
python/*.egg-info/
